# Line endings: always check out LF, on every OS.
#
# The release bundle hashes working-tree bytes (ci/package.py: sha256 of every
# bundled file into manifest.json and SHA256SUMS), so a CRLF checkout on Windows
# would produce different digests than the Linux/macOS CI jobs.  Forcing LF in
# the working tree keeps the digests identical everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets that must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary

# Archives and installers produced by the packaging scripts.
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.deb binary
*.msi binary
*.dmg binary
*.AppImage binary
